OL,3,ARenee Good: Family of US woman killed
OL,4,Aby ICE agent sues Trump officials
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a woman who was killed by
OL,7,Fan immigration agent in Minneapolis has
OL,8,Fannounced two lawsuits against the US
OL,9,Fgovernment and members of the Trump
OL,10,Fadministration.
OL,12,FRenee Good, a US citizen, was shot to
OL,13,Fdeath by an Immigration and Customs
OL,14,FEnforcement (ICE) officer during a
OL,15,Fmajor immigration sweep in January.
OL,16,FMillions watched the video recorded of
OL,17,Fher killing and residents of the
OL,18,FMinnesota city took to the streets to
OL,19,Fprotest.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
